{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 200,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your Chinese weren't good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2200,
    "dDurationMs": 2666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you wouldn't have this wife"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5000,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes I'd pick up the phone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6600,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and start talking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7433,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they had no idea I was a foreigner"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9400,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I argue with him in Chinese all the time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12000,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and... I never win"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13933,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So your entire Chinese learning journey"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16333,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was roughly two to three years, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19266,
    "dDurationMs": 1334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, about that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20733,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hi everyone, I'm Jiajia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24133,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today we're going to talk about how to learn Chinese well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30366,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now of course, I'm not the one to be talking about this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34566,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since Chinese is my mother tongue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37833,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I've invited a special guest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40866,
    "dDurationMs": 6667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Out of all the foreign friends I know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47533,
    "dDurationMs": 1733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he has the best Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49400,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the best pronunciation of anyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53633,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56800,
    "dDurationMs": 966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hahaha"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59233,
    "dDurationMs": 933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hi everyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60166,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He's my husband, Simon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64366,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, hi everyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65633,
    "dDurationMs": 5033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After our Aachen video came out last time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70733,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so many comments in the feed were praising your Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74933,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a lot of people were also really curious"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78000,
    "dDurationMs": 2566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about how you learned Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80566,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So today we're here to chat about that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84833,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, no problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85933,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "haha, let's get started then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87366,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, let's talk about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89266,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what level your Chinese is at right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92733,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's hard to say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94133,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I did take a Chinese proficiency exam"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96733,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the HSK Level 6"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98933,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about three or four years ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101833,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So yes, officially"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104466,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he's HSK 6"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106333,
    "dDurationMs": 4533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because when he took it, the HSK 9 hadn't been introduced yet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110866,
    "dDurationMs": 534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111400,
    "dDurationMs": 666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112066,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113066,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So just how good is his Chinese?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115766,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me give you some examples"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118533,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because we've been living together for so many years now, right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122866,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there are a few specific situations I can think of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127000,
    "dDurationMs": 4566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For instance, when we were living in Chengdu"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131566,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every time we went out, he'd get complimented"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135166,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like taxi drivers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138066,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or restaurant servers would all praise your Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142466,
    "dDurationMs": 934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143400,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That happened pretty regularly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146033,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Though I think a lot of foreigners get that too—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148766,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you say something like \"nǐ hǎo\" or \"xièxiè\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151166,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152000,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Wow, your Chinese is so good!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153433,
    "dDurationMs": 1133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"That's amazing!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155133,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, but in Sichuan it's a bit different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158533,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because everyone there speaks Sichuanese dialect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160800,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a lot of older Sichuan locals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164166,
    "dDurationMs": 2367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't actually speak Mandarin all that well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166566,
    "dDurationMs": 2434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when we were in Chengdu"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169033,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a lot of people would say to him"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171200,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Your Mandarin is more standard than mine\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173633,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"You speak so properly\" — that kind of thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176233,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's true"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177033,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That still happens occasionally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178200,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think it's more just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179000,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do with Mandarin pronunciation specifically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183433,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not really vocabulary or anything like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184666,
    "dDurationMs": 2134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, we do have our Sichuan-accented Mandarin here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187766,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here's another example"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189633,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For instance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190933,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we used to order food delivery a lot in Chengdu"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193633,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the delivery riders would often call him"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196533,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they'd go back and forth chatting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198600,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then when he'd open the door"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200200,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rider would go, \"Oh—\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201833,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"You're a foreigner!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203033,
    "dDurationMs": 1733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I thought you were Chinese!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205000,
    "dDurationMs": 2766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, at first that made things a bit tricky"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207966,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because my pronunciation was pretty solid fairly early on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209966,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "already at a decent level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211366,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so sometimes I'd pick up the phone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213166,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and start talking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214000,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they had no idea I was a foreigner"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215933,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they'd speak really fast"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217333,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I couldn't always catch everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218833,
    "dDurationMs": 1333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that could be a bit challenging"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220166,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they assumed I was Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222933,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I wasn't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225266,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then there's one more example"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227366,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm Chinese, right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230100,
    "dDurationMs": 3466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I argue with him in Chinese all the time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233566,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and... I never win"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236766,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't have much to add to that, do I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239966,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hahaha — I think I've always just enjoyed a good argument"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243633,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or debate, let's say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244933,
    "dDurationMs": 667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "good for you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245600,
    "dDurationMs": 1133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hahaha"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246733,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247333,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let's talk about your journey learning Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251200,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did you get started"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252633,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what did you study — that kind of thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255133,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, so for me it started"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257266,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "probably from my very first trip to Taiwan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261033,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At that point I knew zero Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263266,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and honestly I had no interest in learning it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267033,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I figured I'd just be there for about half a year studying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270766,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then go back home"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272166,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and probably never have a chance to use Chinese again"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274666,
    "dDurationMs": 2934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so at that point I really had no motivation to learn at all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277600,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then I found I really loved life there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280833,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the culture, the history, all of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285633,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the economy felt so dynamic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287400,
    "dDurationMs": 2366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I found it all incredibly vibrant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289766,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was just fascinated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291133,
    "dDurationMs": 3867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I decided I wanted to come back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295000,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe to work, or do an internship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298733,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or do more studying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300800,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I decided that if I was coming back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304000,
    "dDurationMs": 1466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had to learn Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305466,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I could really understand the culture"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308233,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309766,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's when I started teaching myself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312533,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and eventually took classes too, right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314400,
    "dDurationMs": 2566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "though the time spent in classes was probably"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316966,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about a year to two years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318933,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mainly in Taiwan and Beijing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321366,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's probably when I improved the most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324266,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Language immersion is of course so important"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327466,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but not everyone has the opportunity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331000,
    "dDurationMs": 3666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or the time to go and learn a language on location"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334866,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For many people, the biggest challenge in learning Chinese is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338833,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they've learned a lot of vocabulary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340466,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but can't find any native speakers to practice with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343533,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and once they open their mouths, they worry their tones are off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347000,
    "dDurationMs": 4266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you want a more relaxed way to practice your Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351266,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you should give italki a try"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353600,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "italki is an online language learning platform"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357233,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
